      1. POST /api/auth/login {email,password} -> 200, session cookie
         (twoFactorRequired:false at that point — no factors yet)
      2. Privileged roles must enroll 2FA (guard redirects to
         /security?required=1), so TOTP was enrolled through the real
         services over HTTP:
           POST /api/v1/auth.beginTotpEnrollment -> {enrollmentToken, secret}
           TOTP code computed locally (HMAC-SHA1/30s/6-digit, same algorithm
           as src/core/auth/two-factor-crypto.ts)
           POST /api/v1/auth.confirmTotpEnrollment -> ok:true, factor live
      3. Session cookie now passes the admin gate (verified /admin/contacts
         -> 200).
  - All measured admin/editor requests carry this real login session cookie.

